    Written by scratchpad/gen_fab_catalogue.py; that script is the source of truth. An edit
    here survives exactly until the next regeneration and then vanishes with no error.
    Hand-authored recipes live in fn_fabCfg.sqf, which merges this in.

        call AP_fnc_fabGen  ->  [[<recipeRows>], [<schematicRows>]]

