    and 427 derived from shop catalogues. Both are ranked by price
    TOGETHER and spread evenly over the 20 levels -- price orders them, the curve costs them.

    Every one of these is schematic-gated. The intermediates tier and the two printers are
    hand-authored and stay noSchematic, so a new player always has something to build.
*/

